│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ minimax_kvpr_local_search                                                                 │
│ patch_description        │ Replace the current-GPU-pressure greedy rule with a minimax rule that evaluates each      │
│                          │ model's resulting KVPR after placement, including the maximum KVPR of every GPU. This     │
│                          │ directly optimizes the stated objective instead of choosing a GPU based only on its       │
│                          │ pre-placement pressure.                                                                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ After constructing a feasible initial placement, apply bounded local search using model   │
│                          │ relocations and swaps. Each change is accepted only when it strictly lowers the global    │
│                          │ maximum KVPR while preserving GPU memory constraints. Swaps are important because a       │
│                          │ beneficial relocation can require exchanging model memory capacity between two GPUs       │
│                          │ first.                                                                                    │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
