│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ beam_exchange_kvpr                                                                        │
│ patch_description        │ This version replaces the single-path greedy initializer with a compact multi-state beam  │
│                          │ construction. Instead of committing to one GPU choice for each model, it keeps several    │
│                          │ promising partial placements with different packing shapes, ranked by the complete sorted │
│                          │ KVPR profile. This preserves alternatives that are slightly worse early but enable better │
│                          │ memory packing later.                                                                     │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ After construction, a bottleneck-focused improvement phase applies strict lexicographic   │
