│                          │ local-search optimizer improves the complete sorted KVPR profile. Unlike the prior        │
│                          │ version, exchanges are considered from GPUs near the bottleneck as well as the exact      │
│                          │ maximum-pressure GPU, allowing coordinated balancing improvements. The implementation     │
│                          │ keeps strict lexicographic profile improvement, preserving the primary objective of       │
│                          │ minimizing maximum KVPR while ensuring every model fits in GPU memory.                    │
