│ patch_name               │ parametric_binpack                                                                        │
│ patch_description        │ This approach converts a target maximum KVPR into a bin-packing feasibility problem. For  │
│                          │ a KVPR target `T`, every model has transformed size `pressure + T * model_size`, and each │
│                          │ GPU has capacity `T * GPU_MEM_SIZE`. A placement is feasible exactly when these           │
│                          │ transformed sizes fit in the GPU capacities. The algorithm binary-searches the best       │
│                          │ target using diversified best-fit packings, then applies move and swap improvements to    │
│                          │ the resulting placements. This directly optimizes the minimax KVPR objective rather than  │
│                          │ only balancing current ratios greedily.                                                   │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
