│ patch_name               │ diversified_starts_and_relocation_chains                                                  │
│ patch_description        │ Add two complementary deterministic construction orders so the search explores more       │
│                          │ packing patterns before selecting the best initial KVPR profile. This is especially       │
│                          │ useful when high-pressure models and memory-heavy models must be interleaved differently. │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Also add a strict-improvement two-step relocation chain after moves and swaps are         │
│                          │ exhausted. A chain can move one model out of an intermediate GPU to create room for a     │
│                          │ hotspot model, then place that hotspot model into the newly created space. This repairs   │
│                          │ memory-blocked placements that neither a single move nor a direct swap can improve, while │
│                          │ preserving the requirement that every accepted change improves the complete sorted KVPR   │
│                          │ profile.                                                                                  │
