│ patch_description        │ Add one deterministic plateau-diversification step to the strict local search. When no    │
│                          │ improving move exists, a capacity-safe swap that preserves the maximum KVPR (within       │
│                          │ floating-point tolerance) can move the placement into a different local-search basin.     │
│                          │ Strict descent resumes immediately afterward, and only one such perturbation is allowed,  │
│                          │ preventing cycles or substantial runtime growth. Since the perturbation never increases   │
│                          │ the maximum KVPR beyond numerical tolerance, it preserves the primary optimization        │
│                          │ objective while enabling improvements unreachable through strictly improving one- and     │
│                          │ two-model exchanges.                                                                      │
