│ patch_description        │ Add a bounded best-improvement local-search pass after threshold packing. The             │
│                          │ binary-search feasibility routine finds a strong packing, but its multidimensional        │
│                          │ best-fit choices can leave avoidable imbalance because it does not reconsider earlier     │
│                          │ assignments. Relocations and memory-feasible swaps are evaluated against the complete     │
│                          │ descending KVPR profile: the maximum KVPR remains the primary objective, while the        │
│                          │ profile deterministically breaks exact maximum-pressure ties. This can escape greedy      │
│                          │ packing artifacts without changing feasibility guarantees.                                │
